WEBVTT

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:03.200
Your task app remembers everything.

00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:04.733
But what should you do next?

00:00:06.300 --> 00:00:07.033
Mindwtr.

00:00:07.300 --> 00:00:10.333
Free, open source, and built
for your phone and computer.

00:00:10.600 --> 00:00:11.900
No account needed.

00:00:13.300 --> 00:00:16.200
Catch a thought before you
lose it, wherever you are.

00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:19.733
Find what you need in a moment.

00:00:19.967 --> 00:00:23.700
Keep your projects organized, with
room for the ideas you’ll come back to.

00:00:26.300 --> 00:00:30.033
Bring a few tasks into Focus, and give
today a manageable starting point.

00:00:32.300 --> 00:00:35.300
A weekly review helps you keep
track of the bigger picture.

00:00:37.300 --> 00:00:39.367
Your tasks stay on your devices.

00:00:39.567 --> 00:00:40.667
No account required.

00:00:40.767 --> 00:00:43.067
Work offline, and choose how you sync.

00:00:45.300 --> 00:00:47.967
Give Mindwtr a try, and see
if it fits the way you work.

00:00:48.233 --> 00:00:50.667
Download it free at mindwtr.app.
